### Extensión "REST Client" de VS Code: clic en "Send Request" sobre cada bloque.
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Login (la cookie se guarda sola)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "admin", "clave": "admin123" }

### 2. Listar salas
GET {{host}}/api/salas

### 3. Crear reserva (201)
POST {{host}}/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salaId": 1, "responsable": "Ana Pérez", "motivo": "Clase de refuerzo",
  "inicio": "2026-11-02T10:00:00Z", "fin": "2026-11-02T12:00:00Z" }

### 4. Reserva que choca (409)
POST {{host}}/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salaId": 1, "responsable": "Luis Mora",
  "inicio": "2026-11-02T11:00:00Z", "fin": "2026-11-02T13:00:00Z" }

### 5. Datos inválidos (400)
POST {{host}}/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salaId": 1, "responsable": "A", "inicio": "hoy", "fin": "2026-11-02T13:00:00Z" }

### 6. Listar y filtrar
GET {{host}}/api/reservas?salaId=1&fecha=2026-11-02

### 7. Actualizar (use la versión actual de la reserva)
PUT {{host}}/api/reservas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salaId": 1, "responsable": "Ana Pérez", "motivo": "Cambio de motivo",
  "inicio": "2026-11-02T10:00:00Z", "fin": "2026-11-02T12:00:00Z", "version": 1 }

### 8. Eliminar (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/reservas/1

### 9. Cerrar sesión
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
